OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny spells in the
OL,6,Fmorning, but cloudier with
OL,7,Foccasionally heavy showers across
OL,8,FArgyll. Warm in the afternoon with
OL,9,Fsome bright spells and sharp showers
OL,10,Fpossible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry with some sunny
OL,13,Fthen clear spells in the evening, but
OL,14,Fcloudy with some showery and
OL,15,Foccasionally heavy rain over Argyll,
OL,16,Fthis spreading east to all parts
OL,17,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
