OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FRather cloudy with scattered
OL,6,Flight showers and temperatures back
OL,7,Fnear normal for the time of year, but
OL,8,Fsome brighter spells at times as well.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMainly
OL,11,Fcloudy on Saturday with sunny
OL,12,Fintervals and a few light showers.
OL,13,FMainly dry and bright on Sunday.
OL,14,FLikely turning wet and windy on Monday.
